  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded
  notes: 'Plays after the assignment is loaded and unlocks the elevator. Source:
    HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md, stable
    marker Lobby_AssignmentLoaded. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, companion-request volume is currently high across Building A's
      public level. The children's area, work pods, and park-side assistance points
      are all connected to the synchronized network.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: I can see that.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Public companion deployment in this community is one unit for every four
      residents, above the residential average. Building A is one of the company's
      priority demonstration sites.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The benefit is fewer short gaps in care. Parents can continue what they're
      doing, and child users are less likely to be left waiting without a response.
    holdSeconds: 11.338679
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
